# ─── Horizon Relay ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A fresh clone / ZIP must start with ZERO accounts and chats:
# the server creates horizon_relay.db on first run, and each client keeps its
# own history in %LOCALAPPDATA%\HorizonRelay (outside the repository).

# Runtime databases (server accounts + messages, any local test stores)
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Python bytecode & caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Packaging / build output
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.spec

# Logs & temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# Editors / IDEs / assistants
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
.claude/

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# NOT ignored on purpose:
#   assets/backgrounds/purple_black_hole_pingpong.mp4  (lets fresh downloads animate without FFmpeg)
#   assets/backgrounds/purple_black_hole_poster.jpg
#   docs/screenshots/                                    (used by the README)
